OL,3,GNEWSASouth East Water reports loss     
OL,4,Aafter supply issues                    
OL,6,FSouth East Water has reported a        
OL,7,Fhalf-year loss after penalties and #29m
OL,8,Fof costs following disruption to water 
OL,9,Fsupplies over the summer.              
OL,11,FThe company, which serves about 2.4    
OL,12,Fmillion customers across south-east    
OL,13,FEngland, recorded a pre-tax loss of    
OL,14,F#22.9m in the six months to 30         
OL,15,FSeptember, compared with a profit of   
OL,16,F#18.2m during the same period last     
OL,17,Fyear.                                  
