OL,3,GNEWSASouth East Water reports loss     
OL,4,Aafter supply issues                    
OL,6,FIn July, regulator Ofwat ordered the   
OL,7,Fcompany to spend #30.5m on improvements
OL,8,Fafter supply interruptions hit         
OL,9,Fcustomers across Kent and Sussex which 
OL,10,Faffected more than 286,000 customers.  
OL,12,FThe company spent #29m responding to   
OL,13,Ffurther supply interruptions during    
OL,14,Fsummer heatwaves in Kent and Sussex.   
